Architecture
Backend (Node.js + TypeScript)
IMAP sync service using imapflow (supports IDLE/persistent 
connections).
Email processing pipeline: fetch message metadata & body → 
store raw + index in Elasticsearch → call AI categorizer → on 
Interested send Slack + webhook.
REST API to query emails (search/filter) for Postman / frontend.
RAG service: vector DB (Weaviate or Milvus), embeddings + 
retrieval + LLM to generate suggested replies.
Search / Storage
Elasticsearch (docker) for full-text searchable email storage + 
filtering by folder/account.
Vector DB (Weaviate via Docker) for storing product/outreach 


AI
Use an LLM for classification & suggested replies (OpenAI, or 
any hosted LLM).
Use embedding model for vectors (OpenAI embeddings or 
other).
Integrations
Slack Incoming Webhooks for notifications.
Webhook.site as external webhook (for testing).
Frontend
Minimal React (Vite or Next.js) to display list, filter, search (calls 
backend search endpoints). Show category label and suggested 
reply when available.

